        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ef67923ef8a2448c8fb2512e2a04fbc4",
      "statement": "create_agent returns a graph supporting both sync (invoke/stream) and async (ainvoke/astream) execution. The factory creates both sync and async node implementations. If middleware implements only async (awrap_model_call) and is invoked synchronously, it raises NotImplementedError. Middleware should implement both for maximum compatibility.",
